        <mxCell id="EooA235kL_IJkNXCQhz7-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-0&quot; data-is-intersecting=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-0&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-0&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-2&quot; data-scroll-anchor=&quot;false&quot; data-turn=&quot;assistant&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;c4342364-6f5a-4cea-af6d-ccb4237aebaa&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot; data-turn-start-message=&quot;true&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1h4ukh4&quot; data-start=&quot;180&quot; data-end=&quot;196&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 60px;&quot;&gt;1. ISP là gì?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;198&quot; data-end=&quot;230&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;198&quot; data-end=&quot;230&quot;&gt;ISP = Image Signal Processor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;232&quot; data-end=&quot;389&quot;&gt;Camera sensor thực chất không tạo ra ngay một bức ảnh đẹp như ta nhìn thấy. Sensor chỉ thu ánh sáng và xuất ra dữ liệu thô, thường gọi là &lt;strong data-start=&quot;370&quot; data-end=&quot;388&quot;&gt;RAW image data&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;391&quot; data-end=&quot;397&quot;&gt;Ví dụ:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;399&quot; data-end=&quot;556&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ánh sáng&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Camera sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAW pixel data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ảnh RGB/YUV đẹp hơn, sạch hơn, đúng màu hơn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAM / Display / AI / Video encoder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;558&quot; data-end=&quot;603&quot;&gt;Dữ liệu RAW từ sensor thường có nhiều vấn đề:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;605&quot; data-end=&quot;759&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Nhiễu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Màu chưa đúng&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Tối / sáng chưa cân bằng&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Chưa nội suy đủ RGB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Lens bị méo hoặc tối góc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Chưa cân bằng trắng&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Chưa tối ưu độ nét&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;761&quot; data-end=&quot;796&quot;&gt;ISP sinh ra để xử lý các vấn đề đó.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;798&quot; data-end=&quot;801&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1d9cf51&quot; data-start=&quot;803&quot; data-end=&quot;838&quot;&gt;2. ISP thường làm những việc gì?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;840&quot; data-end=&quot;891&quot;&gt;Một pipeline ISP cơ bản thường có các khối như sau:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;893&quot; data-end=&quot;1240&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Camera Sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;MIPI CSI-2 Receiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAW Bayer Data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Black Level Correction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lens Shading Correction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Bad Pixel Correction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Demosaic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;White Balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Color Correction Matrix&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Gamma Correction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Noise Reduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sharpening&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RGB / YUV Output&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Memory / Display / Encoder / NPU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1242&quot; data-end=&quot;1269&quot;&gt;Giải thích từng khối chính:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;sgkev5&quot; data-start=&quot;1271&quot; data-end=&quot;1297&quot;&gt;Black Level Correction&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1299&quot; data-end=&quot;1462&quot;&gt;Sensor không bao giờ có mức đen tuyệt đối bằng 0. Khi không có ánh sáng, pixel vẫn có offset điện áp nhỏ. Khối này trừ đi giá trị nền đó để ảnh không bị “xám đen”.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1464&quot; data-end=&quot;1528&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pixel raw = 64&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Black level = 16&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pixel corrected = 48&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1530&quot; data-end=&quot;1533&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;msucrj&quot; data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1559&quot;&gt;Bad Pixel Correction&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1561&quot; data-end=&quot;1718&quot;&gt;Một số pixel trên sensor có thể bị lỗi, luôn sáng hoặc luôn tối. ISP phát hiện các pixel bất thường và thay thế bằng giá trị nội suy từ các pixel xung quanh.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1720&quot; data-end=&quot;1812&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;10  12  11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;13 255  12   ← pixel lỗi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;11  12  10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP thay 255 bằng giá trị gần 12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1814&quot; data-end=&quot;1817&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;z8roze&quot; data-start=&quot;1819&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;Lens Shading Correction&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1848&quot; data-end=&quot;1934&quot;&gt;Ống kính thường làm vùng rìa ảnh tối hơn vùng giữa. Khối này bù sáng cho các vùng rìa.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1936&quot; data-end=&quot;2058&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Trước xử lý:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tối      Sáng      Tối&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  \       |       /&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   \      |      /&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sau xử lý:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sáng đều hơn toàn ảnh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2060&quot; data-end=&quot;2063&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1xjyz31&quot; data-start=&quot;2065&quot; data-end=&quot;2077&quot;&gt;Demosaic&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2079&quot; data-end=&quot;2180&quot;&gt;Sensor camera phổ biến dùng &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2107&quot; data-end=&quot;2124&quot;&gt;Bayer pattern&lt;/strong&gt;. Mỗi pixel chỉ đo một màu: đỏ, xanh lá hoặc xanh dương.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2182&quot; data-end=&quot;2202&quot;&gt;Ví dụ Bayer pattern:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2204&quot; data-end=&quot;2247&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-