&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;|      ISP       |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;| Image Pipeline |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+----------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    │ RGB/YUV frame&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+----------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;| AXI Master     |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+----------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    │ AXI4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;    ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+----------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;| DDR / SRAM     |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+----------------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; │ AXI4-Lite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP Registers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3897&quot; data-end=&quot;3935&quot;&gt;Ở đây cần phân biệt hai đường dữ liệu:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3937&quot; data-end=&quot;4097&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;1. Đường data lớn:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   Camera frame → ISP → RAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   Dùng AXI4 / AXI-Stream / DMA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;2. Đường control nhỏ:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   CPU cấu hình register ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   Dùng AXI4-Lite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4099&quot; data-end=&quot;4126&quot;&gt;Đây là điểm rất quan trọng.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4128&quot; data-end=&quot;4131&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;1xpfgf5&quot; data-start=&quot;4133&quot; data-end=&quot;4165&quot;&gt;4. Tại sao ISP dùng AXI4-Lite?&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4167&quot; data-end=&quot;4304&quot;&gt;Nói chính xác hơn: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;4186&quot; data-end=&quot;4256&quot;&gt;ISP thường dùng AXI4-Lite cho giao tiếp điều khiển/config register&lt;/strong&gt;, không phải cho truyền toàn bộ dữ liệu ảnh lớn.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4306&quot; data-end=&quot;4349&quot;&gt;ISP có rất nhiều thanh ghi cấu hình, ví dụ:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4351&quot; data-end=&quot;4609&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&qu