t;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Power on sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Enable clock&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Release reset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Read sensor ID via I2C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Write register table for selected mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Configure CSI receiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Start streaming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Receive MIPI packets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pass RAW frame to ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;7552&quot; data-end=&quot;7691&quot;&gt;Một driver IMX219 thường không “xử lý ảnh đẹp”. Nó chủ yếu làm nhiệm vụ điều khiển sensor và khai báo format cho hệ thống camera framework.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;7693&quot; data-end=&quot;7696&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1fbtv8j&quot; data-start=&quot;7698&quot; data-end=&quot;7729&qu