quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot; data-turn-start-message=&quot;true&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;17&quot;&gt;IMX219 Camera&lt;/strong&gt; thường được hiểu là module camera dùng cảm biến &lt;strong data-start=&quot;66&quot; data-end=&quot;81&quot;&gt;Sony IMX219&lt;/strong&gt;, nổi tiếng nhất là trên &lt;strong data-start=&quot;106&quot; data-end=&quot;139&quot;&gt;Raspberry Pi Camera Module v2&lt;/strong&gt;. Đây là cảm biến ảnh CMOS 8MP, xuất dữ liệu ảnh RAW qua giao tiếp &lt;strong data-start=&quot;206&quot; data-end=&quot;220&quot;&gt;MIPI CSI-2&lt;/strong&gt;, rất phổ biến trong embedded Linux, Raspberry Pi, Jetson, FPGA và các bài học về camera pipeline/ISP. Raspberry Pi xác nhận Camera Module v2 dùng cảm biến Sony IMX219 8MP. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;4tpajo&quot; data-start=&quot;432&quot; data-end=&quot;451&quot;&gt;1. IMX219 là gì?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;453&quot; data-end=&quot;502&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;453&quot; data-end=&quot;463&quot;&gt;IMX219&lt;/strong&gt; là một &lt;strong data-start=&quot;471&quot; data-end=&quot;492&quot;&gt;CMOS image sensor&lt;/strong&gt; của Sony.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;504&quot; data-end=&quot;624&quot;&gt;Nó không phải là “camera hoàn chỉnh” theo nghĩa tự xử lý ảnh đẹp như điện thoại. Bản thân cảm biến chủ yếu làm nhiệm vụ:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;626&quot; data-end=&quot;761&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ánh sáng&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lens&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sony IMX219 sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAW Bayer pixel data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;MIPI CSI-2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;SoC / ISP / RAM / CPU / GPU / NPU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;Nói đơn giản:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;778&quot; data-end=&quot;862&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219 = cảm biến thu ánh sáng và biến ánh sáng thành dữ liệu pixel RAW.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;864&quot; data-end=&quot;935&quot;&gt;Sau đó dữ liệu RAW này cần đi qua &lt;strong data-start=&quot;898&quot; data-end=&quot;905&quot;&gt;ISP&lt;/strong&gt; để thành ảnh RGB/YUV đẹp hơn.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;937&quot; data-end=&quot;940&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1p71txz&quot; data-start=&quot;942&quot; data-end=&quot;963&quot;&gt;2. Thông số cơ bản&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;965&quot; data-end=&quot;1003&quot;&gt;Một số thông số thường gặp của IMX219:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;div class=&quot;TyagGW_tableContainer&quot;