ve&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Device tree&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Sensor driver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- MIPI CSI-2 receiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- ISP pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- V4L2 / media controller&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Format RAW10, RAW8, Bayer pattern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Exposure/gain control&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;5848&quot; data-end=&quot;5851&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;husad&quot; data-start=&quot;5853&quot; data-end=&quot;5902&quot;&gt;9. Các khái niệm quan trọng khi làm với IMX219&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;77sbib&quot; data-start=&quot;5904&quot; data-end=&quot;5913&quot;&gt;RAW10&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5915&quot; data-end=&quot;5997&quot;&gt;Nhiều cấu hình IMX219 xuất dữ liệu &lt;strong data-start=&quot;5950&quot; data-end=&quot;5959&quot;&gt;RAW10&lt;/strong&gt;, nghĩa là mỗi pixel có độ sâu 10-bit.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;5999&quot; data-end=&quot;6038&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&q