        ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   │                 +-----------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   │ AXI4-Lite       |   ISP     |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   └──────────────→  | Registers |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;                     +-----------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;                           │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;                           │ AXI4 / DMA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;                           ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;                     +-----------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;                     | DDR RAM   |&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;                     +-----------+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;                           ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;                  Display / Encoder / NPU&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;8607&quot; data-end=&quot;8626&quot;&gt;Trong hệ thống này:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;8628&quot; data-end=&quot;8765&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;I2C        → cấu hình IMX219&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;MIPI CSI-2 → truyền pixel từ IMX219&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI4-Lite  → CPU cấu hình ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI4/DMA   → ghi frame vào RAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;8767&quot; data-end=&quot;8770&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;rcs5hw&quot; data-start=&quot;8772&quot; data-end=&quot;8804&quot;&gt;12. IMX219 phù hợp để học gì?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;8806&quot; data-end=&quot;8842&quot;&gt;IMX219 rất phù hợp nếu bạn muốn học:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;8844&quot; data-end=&quot;9072&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Camera sensor hoạt động thế nào&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- MIPI CSI-2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RAW Bayer format&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- ISP pipeline&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Linux V4L2 camera driver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Device Tree cho camera&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Embedded AI camera input&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Jetson/Raspberry Pi camera stack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- FPGA camera capture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9074&quot; data-end=&quot;9251&quot;&gt;Nếu mục tiêu của bạn là thiết kế hệ thống Edge AI có Camera + ISP + NPU, thì IMX219 là một cảm biến tốt để học vì nó đủ đơn giản, phổ biến và có nhiều tài liệu/module tham khảo.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;9253&quot; data-end=&quot;9256&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1wtpw37&quot; data-start=&quot;9258&quot; data-end=&quot;9278&quot;&gt;Kết luận ngắn gọn&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9280&quot; data-end=&quot;9545&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;9280&quot; data-end=&quot;9297&quot;&gt;IMX219 Camera&lt;/strong&gt; là module camera dùng cảm biến Sony IMX219 8MP. Nó thu ánh sáng qua lens, tạo dữ liệu &lt;strong data-start=&quot;9384&quot; data-end=&quot;9397&quot;&gt;RAW Bayer&lt;/strong&gt;, rồi truyền về SoC qua &lt;strong data-start=&quot;9421&quot; data-end=&quot;9435&quot;&gt;MIPI CSI-2&lt;/strong&gt;. CPU cấu hình sensor thông qua &lt;strong data-start=&quot;9467&quot; data-end=&quot;9474&quot;&gt;I2C&lt;/strong&gt;, còn việc biến RAW thành ảnh đẹp thường do &lt;strong data-start=&quot;9518&quot; data-end=&quot;9525&quot;&gt;ISP&lt;/strong&gt; trong SoC đảm nhận.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9547&quot; data-end=&quot;9555&quot;&gt;Tóm tắt:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;9557&quot; data-end=&quot;9752&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219 = camera sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;I2C = đường cấu hình sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;MIPI CSI-2 = đường truyền dữ liệu ảnh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP = xử lý RAW thành RGB/YUV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;AXI/DMA = ghi frame vào RAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU/NPU = dùng frame cho app hoặc AI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" id="EooA235kL_IJkNXCQhz7-2">
