;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- 1 cặp clock lane&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- 1, 2 hoặc 4 cặp data lane&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2491&quot; data-end=&quot;2511&quot;&gt;Ví dụ camera 2-lane:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2513&quot; data-end=&quot;2635&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Camera Sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ├── CLK+ / CLK-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ├── DATA0+ / DATA0-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   └── DATA1+ / DATA1-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;        ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;SoC CSI Receiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2637&quot; data-end=&quot;2736&quot;&gt;Mỗi lane là tín hiệu vi sai, tức là dùng cặp dây &lt;code data-start=&quot;2686&quot; data-end=&quot;2689&quot;&gt;+&lt;/code&gt; và &lt;code data-start=&quot;2693&quot; data-end=&quot;2696&quot;&gt;-&lt;/code&gt;, giúp chống nhiễu tốt hơn ở tốc độ cao.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2738&quot; data-end=&quot;2785&quot;&gt;Ví dụ IMX219 thường dùng cấu hình CSI-2 2-lane:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2787&quot; data-end=&quot;2854&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓ 2-lane MIPI CSI-2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Raspberry Pi / Jetson / SoC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2856&quot; data-end=&quot;2859&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;wbon0f&quot; data-start=&quot;2861&quot; data-end=&quot;2922&quot;&gt;6. Vì sao MIPI CSI-2 được ứng dụng nhiều trong camera ISP?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2924&quot; data-end=&quot;2972&quot;&gt;Vì nó rất hợp với kiến trúc camera sensor → ISP.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;10kjxub&quot; data-start=&quot;2974&quot; data-end=&quot;3001&quot;&gt;Lý do 1: Băng thông cao&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3003&quot; data-end=&quot;3103&quot;&gt;Camera cần truyền hàng trăm Mbps đến nhiều Gbps. CSI-2 được thiết kế cho video/ảnh độ phân giải cao.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3105&quot; data-end=&quot;3188&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;1080p30  → vài trăm Mbps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;4K30     → vài Gbps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Nhiều camera → còn cao hơn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3190&quot; data-end=&quot;3193&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1af7cj2&quot; data-start=&quot;3195&quot; data-end=&quot;3224&quot;&gt;Lý do 2: Ít chân tín hiệu&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3226&quot; data-end=&quot;3298&quot;&gt;So với giao tiếp song song đời cũ, MIPI CSI-2 dùng ít pin hơn rất nhiều.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3300&quot; data-end=&quot;3331&quot;&gt;Giao tiếp song song có thể cần:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3333&quot; data-end=&quot;3411&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;8/10/12 bit data bus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+ pixel clock&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+ hsync&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+ vsync&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;+ control lines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3413&quot; data-end=&quot;3434&quot;&gt;CSI-2 có thể chỉ cần:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3436&quot; data-end=&quot;3475&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 clock lane + 2 data lanes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3477&quot; data-end=&quot;3498&quot;&gt;Ít chân hơn nghĩa là:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3500&quot; data-end=&quot;3608&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- PCB gọn hơn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Connector nhỏ hơn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Phù hợp điện thoại/module nhỏ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Dễ tích hợp nhiều camera hơn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3610&quot; data-end=&quot;3613&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;divt06&quot; data-start=&quot;3615&quot; data-end=&quot;3646&quot;&gt;Lý do 3: Tiêu thụ điện thấp&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3648&quot; data-end=&quot;3927&quot;&gt;Camera trong điện thoại, drone, SBC, robot cần tiết kiệm điện. MIPI PHY có chế độ high-speed để truyền dữ liệu và low-power để điều khiển/trạng thái. D-PHY được MIPI mô tả là có khả năng chuyển độ trễ thấp giữa high-speed và low-power modes. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3929&quot; data-end=&quot;3932&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;g3nodk&quot; data-start=&quot;3934&quot; data-end=&quot;3972&quot;&gt;Lý do 4: Phù hợp dữ liệu streaming&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3974&quot; data-end=&quot;4024&quot;&gt;Camera sensor xuất pixel liên tục theo frame/line:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4026&quot; data-end=&quot;4113&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Frame start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Line 1 pixels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Line 2 pixels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Line 3 pixels&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Frame end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4115&quot; data-end=&quot;4182&quot;&gt;CSI-2 đóng gói dữ liệu theo packet, rất hợp với luồng ảnh liên tục.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4184&quot; data-end=&quot;4187&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;65e7qd&quot; data-start=&quot;4189&quot; data-end=&quot;4230&quot;&gt;Lý do 5: Hỗ trợ RAW trực tiếp cho ISP&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4232&quot; data-end=&quot;4264&quot;&gt;ISP cần nhận RAW Bayer để xử lý:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4266&quot; data-end=&quot;4392&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAW Bayer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Black level correction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Demosaic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;White balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Color correction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Noise reduction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt; ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RGB/YUV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4394&quot; data-end=&quot;4490&quot;&gt;CSI-2 hỗ trợ truyền các định dạng RAW phổ biến, nên rất phù hợp để nối sensor trực tiếp vào ISP.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4492&quot; data-end=&quot;4495&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;ocp5b7&quot; data-start=&quot;4497&quot; data-end=&quot;4546&quot;&gt;7. MIPI CSI-2 khác gì với I2C, AXI, AXI4-Lite?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4548&quot; data-end=&quot;4572&quot;&gt;Đây là điểm rất dễ nhầm.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4574&quot; data-end=&quot;4630&quot;&gt;Trong một hệ camera, các giao tiếp có vai trò khác nhau:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4632&quot; data-end=&quot;4812&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU ── I2C ─────────────→ Camera Sensor registers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Camera Sensor ── CSI-2 ─→ CSI Receiver / ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU ── AXI4-Lite ───────→ ISP registers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP/DMA ── AXI4 ────────→ DDR RAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4814&quot; data-end=&quot;4822&quot;&gt;So sánh:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;div class=&quot;TyagGW_tableContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;div tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit&quot;&gt;&lt;table data-start=&quot;4824&quot; data-end=&quot;5181&quot; class=&quot;w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)&quot;&gt;&lt;thead data-start=&quot;4824&quot; data-end=&quot;4876&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;4824&quot; data-end=&quot;4876&quot;&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;4824&quot; data-end=&quot;4836&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;Giao tiếp&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;4836&quot; data-end=&quot;4854&quot; data-col-size=&quot;md&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;Dùng để làm gì?&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;4854&quot; data-end=&quot;4876&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;Dữ liệu lớn không?&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody data-start=&quot;4891&quot; data-end=&quot;5181&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;4891&quot; data-end=&quot;4950&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;4891&quot; data-end=&quot;4901&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4893&quot; data-end=&quot;4900&quot;&gt;I2C&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;4901&quot; data-end=&quot;4941&quot; data-col-size=&quot;md&quot;&gt;Cấu hình sensor: exposure, gain, mode&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; data-start=&quot;4941&quot; data-end=&quot;4950&quot;&gt;Không&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;4951&quot; data-end=&quot;5007&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;4951&quot; data-end=&quot;4968&quot