        <UserObject label="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 64px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;ab82f3bf-d876-44ce-9440-632b76daa84a&quot; data-is-intersecting=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-(--header-height)&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;ab82f3bf-d876-44ce-9440-632b76daa84a&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;ab82f3bf-d876-44ce-9440-632b76daa84a&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-19&quot; data-scroll-anchor=&quot;false&quot; data-turn=&quot;user&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto pt-12 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;user&quot; data-message-id=&quot;ab82f3bf-d876-44ce-9440-632b76daa84a&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex flex-col w-fit max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%) items-start self-end rtl:items-end rtl:self-start&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-custom-highlighting-behavior=&quot;boundary&quot; class=&quot;A_HxFq_root&quot; data-testid=&quot;collapsible-user-message-root&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;_r_1d3_&quot; data-testid=&quot;collapsible-user-message-content&quot; class=&quot;A_HxFq_content&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;max-w-full min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 64px;&quot;&gt;mudule camera &#39;IMX219&#39; đã tích hợp bộ đóng gói packet(packetizer) để truyền kiểu CSI-2 chưa.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;max-w-full min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 64px;&quot;&gt;Có thể hay có cần cấu hình lại packetizer đó không?&lt;br&gt;Giải thích cơ chế streaming CSI-2 làm thế nào để CSI-2 đảm bảo các frame được truyền liên tục tốc độ cao trên nhiều lane.&lt;br&gt;Nếu có 2 lane cùng lúc truyền dữ liệu thì cơ chế nào giúp CSI receiver phát hiện thứ tự packet trước sau.&lt;br&gt;Tại sao không tích hợp CSI-2 Receiver luôn trên ISP mà phải chuyển qua AXI rồi truyền vào ISP&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;z-0 flex justify-end&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-9&quot; data-is-intersecting=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-9&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;request-WEB:4c4a8201-3a44-414f-89bc-b502308339f9-9&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-20&quot; data-scroll-anchor=&quot;false&quot; data-turn=&quot;assistant&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;460c1084-a77d-4bf3-a2b3-e196ac5e8837&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;267&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Mình sẽ trả lời theo hướng thiết kế hệ thống thật: sensor IMX219 → CSI-2 TX/packetizer → D-PHY lanes → CSI receiver → ISP/VI/DMA. Có vài chỗ dễ nhầm, đặc biệt là “nhiều lane truyền song song” nhưng CSI-2 vẫn giữ thứ tự byte/packet bằng quy tắc phân phối lane cố định.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center justify-between&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)&quot;&gt;Thought for 28s&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; data-rtl-flip=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;icon-xs&quot;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;bd4e3576-77c8-49a6-9d4b-5d9b88d2701d&quot; data-turn-start-message=&quot;true&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1eg60nf&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;48&quot;&gt;1. IMX219 module đã có CSI-2 packetizer chưa?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;50&quot; data-end=&quot;242&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;50&quot; data-end=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Có.&lt;/strong&gt; Với camera sensor như &lt;strong data-start=&quot;80&quot; data-end=&quot;95&quot;&gt;Sony IMX219&lt;/strong&gt;, bên trong sensor đã có khối &lt;strong data-start=&quot;125&quot; data-end=&quot;146&quot;&gt;CSI-2 transmitter&lt;/strong&gt;, bao gồm phần đóng gói dữ liệu ảnh thành &lt;strong data-start=&quot;188&quot; data-end=&quot;205&quot;&gt;CSI-2 packets&lt;/strong&gt; rồi đẩy ra ngoài qua &lt;strong data-start=&quot;227&quot; data-end=&quot;241&quot;&gt;MIPI D-PHY&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;244&quot; data-end=&quot;476&quot;&gt;Trong datasheet IMX219 có ghi rõ sensor hỗ trợ &lt;strong data-start=&quot;291&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;CSI-2 serial data output&lt;/strong&gt;, chọn được &lt;strong data-start=&quot;331&quot; data-end=&quot;353&quot;&gt;4-lane hoặc 2-lane&lt;/strong&gt;, có &lt;strong data-start=&quot;358&quot; data-end=&quot;389&quot;&gt;2-wire serial communication&lt;/strong&gt; để cấu hình, và tốc độ dữ liệu tối đa theo lane. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;478&quot; data-end=&quot;514&quot;&gt;Sơ đồ bên trong có thể hiểu như sau:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;516&quot; data-end=&quot;1177&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219 sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;┌────────────────────────────────────────────┐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ Pixel array                                │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│   ↓                                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ ADC 10-bit                                 │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│   ↓                                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ Timing generator                           │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│   ↓                                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ RAW Bayer formatter                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│   ↓                                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ CSI-2 packetizer / CSI-2 TX                │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│   ↓                                        │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ MIPI D-PHY transmitter                     │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;└────────────────────────────────────────────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;        ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   CSI-2 lanes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1311&quot;&gt;Nên khi bạn dùng IMX219, bạn &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1208&quot; data-end=&quot;1251&quot;&gt;không phải tự viết packetizer bên ngoài&lt;/strong&gt; nếu chỉ muốn lấy ảnh từ sensor. Sensor đã tự đóng gói kiểu:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1313&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Frame Start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Long Packet chứa RAW8/RAW10 line data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Long Packet chứa RAW8/RAW10 line data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;Frame End&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1431&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1effuoo&quot; data-start=&quot;1433&quot; data-end=&quot;1487&quot;&gt;2. Có cần cấu hình lại packetizer của IMX219 không?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1538&quot;&gt;Không cấu hình packetizer như một block riêng&lt;/strong&gt;, nhưng bạn &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1550&quot; data-end=&quot;1619&quot;&gt;có cấu hình các tham số làm packetizer thay đổi cách xuất dữ liệu&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1622&quot; data-end=&quot;1673&quot;&gt;Thông thường driver sẽ cấu hình IMX219 qua &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1665&quot; data-end=&quot;1672&quot;&gt;I2C&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1675&quot; data-end=&quot;1722&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;CPU / SoC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓ I2C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;IMX219 registers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1724&quot; data-end=&quot;1756&quot;&gt;Các tham số thường cấu hình gồm:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1758&quot; data-end=&quot;1964&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Độ phân giải&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Crop/window&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Frame rate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- RAW8 hay RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Exposure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Analog gain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Digital gain&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Test pattern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- PLL/link frequency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Số lane CSI-2 nếu phần cứng hỗ trợ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Start/stop streaming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1966&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;Linux camera stack cũng mô tả sensor driver chịu trách nhiệm cấu hình camera sensor qua I2C/SPI; với IMX219, driver hỗ trợ Bayer 8-bit và 10-bit, các control như pixel rate, blanking, exposure, gain, flip và test pattern. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2227&quot; data-end=&quot;2269&quot;&gt;Tức là bạn thường không ghi register kiểu:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2271&quot; data-end=&quot;2328&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;PACKETIZER_ENABLE = 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;PACKETIZER_MODE = RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2330&quot; data-end=&quot;2394&quot;&gt;một cách tách biệt. Thay vào đó bạn chọn &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2371&quot; data-end=&quot;2386&quot;&gt;sensor mode&lt;/strong&gt;, ví dụ:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2396&quot; data-end=&quot;2476&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;3280 × 2464 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;1920 × 1080 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;1640 × 1232 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAW8 test mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2478&quot; data-end=&quot;2520&quot;&gt;Rồi sensor tự xuất CSI-2 packet tương ứng.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2522&quot; data-end=&quot;2790&quot;&gt;Lưu ý quan trọng: &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2540&quot; data-end=&quot;2588&quot;&gt;chip IMX219 có thể hỗ trợ 2-lane hoặc 4-lane&lt;/strong&gt;, nhưng &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2596&quot; data-end=&quot;2613&quot;&gt;module cụ thể&lt;/strong&gt; có thể chỉ nối ra 2 lane. Ví dụ các module kiểu Raspberry Pi Camera v2 thường dùng cấu hình 2-lane. Vì vậy không phải cứ sensor hỗ trợ 4-lane là board của bạn dùng được 4-lane.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2792&quot; data-end=&quot;2795&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1 data-section-id=&quot;z8xw4j&quot; data-start=&quot;2797&quot; data-end=&quot;2876&quot;&gt;3. CSI-2 streaming hoạt động như thế nào để truyền frame liên tục tốc độ cao?&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2878&quot; data-end=&quot;3028&quot;&gt;CSI-2 truyền dữ liệu theo kiểu &lt;strong data-start=&quot;2909&quot; data-end=&quot;2935&quot;&gt;streaming packet-based&lt;/strong&gt;. Khi bật stream, sensor liên tục quét ảnh theo frame, theo line, rồi packetize và truyền đi.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3030&quot; data-end=&quot;3046&quot;&gt;Luồng tổng quát:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3048&quot; data-end=&quot;3190&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pixel array&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ADC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;RAW Bayer data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI-2 packetizer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;D-PHY HS transmission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI-2 Receiver&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP / DMA / RAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3192&quot; data-end=&quot;3227&quot;&gt;Một frame có thể hình dung như sau:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3229&quot; data-end=&quot;3446&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;FS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line 0 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line 1 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line 2 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line N RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line 0 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  Long Packet: Line 1 RAW10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3448&quot; data-end=&quot;3457&quot;&gt;Trong đó:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3459&quot; data-end=&quot;3502&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;FS = Frame Start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;FE = Frame End&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3504&quot; data-end=&quot;3531&quot;&gt;Một số sensor cũng có thêm:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3533&quot; data-end=&quot;3574&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;LS = Line Start&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;LE = Line End&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3576&quot; data-end=&quot;3633&quot;&gt;nhưng không phải hệ nào cũng bắt buộc dùng LS/LE rõ ràng.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3635&quot; data-end=&quot;3638&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1g5er9t&quot; data-start=&quot;3640&quot; data-end=&quot;3692&quot;&gt;4. Điều gì giúp CSI-2 truyền liên tục tốc độ cao?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3694&quot; data-end=&quot;3712&quot;&gt;Có 5 cơ chế chính.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;4jmzn5&quot; data-start=&quot;3714&quot; data-end=&quot;3764&quot;&gt;Thứ nhất: truyền nối tiếp tốc độ cao qua D-PHY&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3766&quot; data-end=&quot;3902&quot;&gt;Khi chưa truyền, lane ở trạng thái &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3801&quot; data-end=&quot;3815&quot;&gt;LP-11 idle&lt;/strong&gt;. Khi bắt đầu stream, transmitter chuyển sang &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3861&quot; data-end=&quot;3872&quot;&gt;HS mode&lt;/strong&gt; để truyền dữ liệu tốc độ cao.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3904&quot; data-end=&quot;4101&quot;&gt;Linux CSI-2 documentation mô tả transmitter nên giữ LP-11 khi powered nhưng chưa active; chỉ khi stream-on thì mới kích hoạt clock lane và chuyển sang HS mode. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4103&quot; data-end=&quot;4212&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;LP-11 idle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓ stream on&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;HS mode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;   ↓ truyền packet liên tục&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;LP-11 hoặc tiếp tục HS tùy mode/gap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4214&quot; data-end=&quot;4217&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1t1hzap&quot; data-start=&quot;4219&quot; data-end=&quot;4259&quot;&gt;Thứ hai: nhiều lane truyền song song&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4261&quot; data-end=&quot;4394&quot;&gt;Nếu dùng 2 lane, dữ liệu packet không phải “copy nguyên packet lên cả 2 lane”. Thay vào đó, CSI-2 chia byte của packet ra nhiều lane.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4396&quot; data-end=&quot;4421&quot;&gt;Ví dụ packet byte stream:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4423&quot; data-end=&quot;4462&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;B0 B1 B2 B3 B4 B5 B6 B7 ...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4464&quot; data-end=&quot;4480&quot;&gt;Với 2 data lane:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4482&quot; data-end=&quot;4547&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=