l w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓ CSI-2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI-2 RX IP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓ AXI-Stream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP IP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓ AXI4 / DMA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;DDR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10353&quot; data-end=&quot;10431&quot;&gt;Ở đây &lt;strong data-start=&quot;10359&quot; data-end=&quot;10373&quot;&gt;AXI-Stream&lt;/strong&gt; không phải DDR memory bus, mà là stream nội bộ cho pixel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;10433&quot; data-end=&quot;10436&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;prdlgw&quot; data-start=&quot;10438&quot; data-end=&quot;10498&quot;&gt;9. Vậy tại sao nhiều hệ lại tách CSI-2 Receiver khỏi ISP?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10500&quot; data-end=&quot;10521&quot;&gt;Có vài lý do thực tế.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;t1t9gp&quot; data-start=&quot;10523&quot; data-end=&quot;10601&quot;&gt;Lý do 1: CSI-2 RX là khối giao tiếp vật lý/protocol, ISP là khối xử lý ảnh&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10603&quot; data-end=&quot;10629&quot;&gt;CSI-2 Receiver phải xử lý:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;10631&quot; data-end=&quot;10754&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot