gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;DDR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓ AXI4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10124&quot; data-end=&quot;10172&quot;&gt;Kiến trúc này dùng memory làm buffer trung gian.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;10174&quot; data-end=&quot;10177&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1uaj38i&quot; data-start=&quot;10179&quot; data-end=&quot;10227&quot;&gt;Kiến trúc 3: CSI-2 RX xuất AXI-Stream vào ISP&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10229&quot; data-end=&quot;10268&quot;&gt;Trong FPGA hoặc SoC modular, thường có:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;10270&quot; data-end=&quot;10351&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Sensor&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓ CSI-2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;CSI-2 RX IP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓ AXI-Stream&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;ISP IP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;  ↓ AXI4 / DMA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;DDR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10353&quot; data-end=&quot;10431&quot;&gt;Ở đây &lt;strong data-start=&quot;10359&quot; data-end=&quot;10373&quot;&gt;AXI-Stream&lt;/strong&gt; không phải DDR memory bus, mà là stream nội bộ cho pixel.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;10433&quot; data-end=&quot;10436&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;prdlgw&quot; data-start=&quot;10438&quot; data-end=&quot;10498&quot;&gt;9. Vậy tại sao nhiều hệ lại tách CSI-2 Receiver khỏi ISP?&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10500&quot; data-end=&quot;10521&quot;&gt;Có vài lý do thực tế.&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;t1t9gp&quot; data-start=&quot;10523&quot; data-end=&quot;10601&quot;&gt;Lý do 1: CSI-2 RX là khối giao tiếp vật lý/protocol, ISP là khối xử lý ảnh&lt;/h3&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10603&quot; data-end=&quot;10629&quot;&gt;CSI-2 Receiver phải xử lý:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;10631&quot; data-end=&quot;10754&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;- D-PHY analog/front-end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- HS/LP state&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- lane alignment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- packet decode&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- ECC/CRC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Virtual Channel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;- Data Type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10756&quot; data-end=&quot;10770&quot;&gt;ISP lại xử lý:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;10772&quot; data-end=&quot;10942&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-event