whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden items-end rtl:items-start&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;user-message-bubble-color corner-superellipse/0.98 relative min-w-0 overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] px-4 py-2.5 leading-6 max-w-(--user-chat-width,70%)&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;max-w-full min-w-0 [overflow-wrap:anywhere] whitespace-pre-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 64px;&quot;&gt;giới thiệu cho tôi về khối IP frame buffer write, frame buffer read của xilinx, giải thích cơ chế hoạt dộng và đưa cho tôi tài liệu hãng liên quan&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;z-0 flex justify-end&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;b1d564f1-ae02-4b9c-a258-fc4564098ca1&quot; data-is-intersecting=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;section class=&quot;text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;amp;:has([data-writing-block])&amp;gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-turn-id=&quot;b1d564f1-ae02-4b9c-a258-fc4564098ca1&quot; data-turn-id-container=&quot;b1d564f1-ae02-4b9c-a258-fc4564098ca1&quot; data-testid=&quot;conversation-turn-6&quot; data-scroll-anchor=&quot;false&quot; data-turn=&quot;assistant&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-conversation-screenshot-content=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;e5cd53ac-5ab7-4125-8e72-60b3e0ce5223&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;150&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center justify-between&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; class=&quot;text-token-text-tertiary hover:text-token-text-primary dark:hover:text-token-text-primary flex items-center gap-0.5 text-start dark:text-(--interactive-label-tertiary-default)&quot;&gt;Thought for 26s&lt;svg xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; data-rtl-flip=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;icon-xs&quot;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;3cf3073c-91e8-469b-bd06-0b61fb3b2c7f&quot; data-turn-start-message=&quot;true&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot; data-message-model-slug=&quot;gpt-5-5-thinking&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;72&quot;&gt;Dưới đây là phần giới thiệu theo đúng ngữ cảnh pipeline ISP/NPU của bạn.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;74&quot; data-end=&quot;122&quot;&gt;1. Frame Buffer Write / Read của Xilinx là gì?&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;124&quot; data-end=&quot;164&quot;&gt;Tên đầy đủ trong tài liệu AMD/Xilinx là:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;166&quot; data-end=&quot;260&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;166&quot; data-end=&quot;234&quot;&gt;Video Frame Buffer Read and Video Frame Buffer Write LogiCORE IP&lt;/strong&gt;, tài liệu hãng &lt;strong data-start=&quot;250&quot; data-end=&quot;259&quot;&gt;PG278&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;262&quot; data-end=&quot;391&quot;&gt;Theo AMD, hai IP này cung cấp cơ chế &lt;strong data-start=&quot;299&quot; data-end=&quot;376&quot;&gt;DMA băng thông cao giữa AXI4-Stream Video và AXI4 memory-mapped interface&lt;/strong&gt;. Nói đơn giản:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;393&quot; data-end=&quot;525&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Frame Buffer Write:&lt;br&gt;AXI4-Stream Video  -&amp;gt;  AXI Memory / DDR&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Frame Buffer Read:&lt;br&gt;AXI Memory / DDR   -&amp;gt;  AXI4-Stream Video&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;527&quot; data-end=&quot;802&quot;&gt;AMD mô tả hai IP này dùng để truy cập hiệu quả giữa &lt;strong data-start=&quot;579&quot; data-end=&quot;610&quot;&gt;AXI4-Stream video interface&lt;/strong&gt; và &lt;strong data-start=&quot;614&quot; data-end=&quot;639&quot;&gt;AXI4 memory interface&lt;/strong&gt;, đặc biệt hữu ích khi ứng dụng video cần frame buffer để đổi frame rate, scale/crop hoặc tách các khối xử lý video bằng DDR.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;804&quot; data-end=&quot;807&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;809&quot; data-end=&quot;848&quot;&gt;2. Vai trò trong ISP pipeline của bạn&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;850&quot; data-end=&quot;967&quot;&gt;Trong pipeline bạn đang review, Xilinx Frame Buffer Write/Read đóng vai trò như &lt;strong data-start=&quot;930&quot; data-end=&quot;966&quot;&gt;cầu nối giữa video stream và DDR&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;969&quot; data-end=&quot;988&quot;&gt;Ví dụ pipeline gốc:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;990&quot; data-end=&quot;1161&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;IMX219&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; MIPI CSI-2 RX&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; Frame Buffer Write 0&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; DDR Buffer A&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; Frame Buffer Read&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; ISP-Lite&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; VIP&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; Frame Buffer Write 1&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; DDR Buffer B&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; NPU&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1163&quot; data-end=&quot;1181&quot;&gt;Ý nghĩa từng khối:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1183&quot; data-end=&quot;1427&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Frame Buffer Write 0:&lt;br&gt;ghi RAW frame sau MIPI RX xuống DDR Buffer A&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Frame Buffer Read:&lt;br&gt;đọc RAW frame từ DDR Buffer A và phát lại thành video stream cho ISP-Lite&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Frame Buffer Write 1:&lt;br&gt;ghi output sau VIP xuống DDR Buffer B để NPU đọc&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1429&quot; data-end=&quot;1552&quot;&gt;Nói cách khác, &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1444&quot; data-end=&quot;1491&quot;&gt;Frame Buffer Write là chiều capture vào DDR&lt;/strong&gt;, còn &lt;strong data-start=&quot;1497&quot; data-end=&quot;1551&quot;&gt;Frame Buffer Read là chiều replay từ DDR ra stream&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;1554&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;1559&quot; data-end=&quot;1590&quot;&gt;3. Cơ chế hoạt động tổng quát&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;1592&quot; data-end=&quot;1640&quot;&gt;3.1 Frame Buffer Write hoạt động như thế nào?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1716&quot;&gt;Frame Buffer Write nhận video dạng streaming, thường là AXI4-Stream Video:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1861&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;s_axis_video_tdata&lt;br&gt;s_axis_video_tvalid&lt;br&gt;s_axis_video_tready&lt;br&gt;s_axis_video_tuser   = Start of Frame&lt;br&gt;s_axis_video_tlast   = End of Line&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1863&quot; data-end=&quot;1981&quot;&gt;Sau đó IP đóng gói dữ liệu pixel thành các AXI memory transaction để ghi xuống DDR qua AXI4 memory-mapped master port.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;1983&quot; data-end=&quot;1999&quot;&gt;Luồng hoạt động:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2001&quot; data-end=&quot;2162&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Video stream vào&lt;br&gt;   |&lt;br&gt;   | tuser báo pixel đầu frame&lt;br&gt;   | tlast báo cuối line&lt;br&gt;   v&lt;br&gt;Frame Buffer Write&lt;br&gt;   |&lt;br&gt;   | AXI burst write&lt;br&gt;   v&lt;br&gt;DDR frame buffer&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2164&quot; data-end=&quot;2170&quot;&gt;Ví dụ:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2172&quot; data-end=&quot;2294&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Frame 1280x720 RGB888&lt;br&gt;width  = 1280&lt;br&gt;height = 720&lt;br&gt;stride = 1280 * 3 = 3840 bytes/line&lt;br&gt;base address = 0x80000000&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2296&quot; data-end=&quot;2322&quot;&gt;Frame Buffer Write sẽ ghi:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2324&quot; data-end=&quot;2438&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;line 0 -&amp;gt; DDR[base + 0 * stride]&lt;br&gt;line 1 -&amp;gt; DDR[base + 1 * stride]&lt;br&gt;line 2 -&amp;gt; DDR[base + 2 * stride]&lt;br&gt;...&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2440&quot; data-end=&quot;2513&quot;&gt;Khi ghi xong frame, IP có thể phát interrupt hoặc driver báo buffer DONE.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;2515&quot; data-end=&quot;2518&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;2520&quot; data-end=&quot;2567&quot;&gt;3.2 Frame Buffer Read hoạt động như thế nào?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2569&quot; data-end=&quot;2685&quot;&gt;Frame Buffer Read làm ngược lại. Nó đọc frame từ DDR bằng AXI4 memory-mapped read, sau đó phát ra AXI4-Stream Video:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2687&quot; data-end=&quot;2946&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;DDR frame buffer&lt;br&gt;   |&lt;br&gt;   | AXI burst read&lt;br&gt;   v&lt;br&gt;Frame Buffer Read&lt;br&gt;   |&lt;br&gt;   | m_axis_video_tdata&lt;br&gt;   | m_axis_video_tvalid&lt;br&gt;   | m_axis_video_tready&lt;br&gt;   | m_axis_video_tuser = Start of Frame&lt;br&gt;   | m_axis_video_tlast = End of Line&lt;br&gt;   v&lt;br&gt;Video stream output&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;2948&quot; data-end=&quot;2973&quot;&gt;Ví dụ trong ISP pipeline:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;2975&quot; data-end=&quot;3079&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;DDR Buffer A chứa RAW frame&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; Frame Buffer Read&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; phát lại RAW stream&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; ISP-Lite xử lý&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3081&quot; data-end=&quot;3108&quot;&gt;Frame Buffer Read cần biết:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;3110&quot; data-end=&quot;3174&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;base address&lt;br&gt;width&lt;br&gt;height&lt;br&gt;stride&lt;br&gt;memory video format&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3176&quot; data-end=&quot;3271&quot;&gt;Nếu cấu hình sai stride hoặc format, frame output sẽ bị lệch dòng, sai màu hoặc sai kích thước.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;3273&quot; data-end=&quot;3276&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;3278&quot; data-end=&quot;3305&quot;&gt;4. Interface chính của IP&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;3307&quot; data-end=&quot;3341&quot;&gt;4.1 AXI4-Stream Video interface&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3343&quot; data-end=&quot;3628&quot;&gt;AMD ghi rõ Frame Buffer Write/Read có interface video dạng &lt;code data-start=&quot;3402&quot; data-end=&quot;3416&quot;&gt;s_axis_video&lt;/code&gt; hoặc &lt;code data-start=&quot;3422&quot; data-end=&quot;3436&quot;&gt;m_axis_video&lt;/code&gt;; các interface này theo chuẩn &lt;strong data-start=&quot;3467&quot; data-end=&quot;3488&quot;&gt;AXI4-Stream Video&lt;/strong&gt;. IP có thể cấu hình single/dual/quad/octa pixels per clock và hỗ trợ 8, 10 hoặc 12 bit mỗi component.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3630&quot; data-end=&quot;3654&quot;&gt;Các tín hiệu quan trọng:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;TyagGW_tableContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;div tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit&quot;&gt;&lt;table data-start=&quot;3656&quot; data-end=&quot;3880&quot; class=&quot;w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)&quot;&gt;&lt;thead data-start=&quot;3656&quot; data-end=&quot;3676&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;3656&quot; data-end=&quot;3676&quot;&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;3656&quot; data-end=&quot;3665&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;Signal&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;3665&quot; data-end=&quot;3676&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;Ý nghĩa&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody data-start=&quot;3687&quot; data-end=&quot;3880&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;3687&quot; data-end=&quot;3714&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3687&quot; data-end=&quot;3697&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;3689&quot; data-end=&quot;3696&quot;&gt;tdata&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3697&quot; data-end=&quot;3714&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;dữ liệu pixel&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;3715&quot; data-end=&quot;3741&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3715&quot; data-end=&quot;3726&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;3717&quot; data-end=&quot;3725&quot;&gt;tvalid&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3726&quot; data-end=&quot;3741&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;data hợp lệ&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;3742&quot; data-end=&quot;3781&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3742&quot; data-end=&quot;3753&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;3744&quot; data-end=&quot;3752&quot;&gt;tready&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3753&quot; data-end=&quot;3781&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;downstream sẵn sàng nhận&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;3782&quot; data-end=&quot;3810&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3782&quot; data-end=&quot;3792&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;3784&quot; data-end=&quot;3791&quot;&gt;tuser&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3792&quot; data-end=&quot;3810&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Start of Frame&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;3811&quot; data-end=&quot;3836&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3811&quot; data-end=&quot;3821&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;3813&quot; data-end=&quot;3820&quot;&gt;tlast&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3821&quot; data-end=&quot;3836&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;End of Line&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;3837&quot; data-end=&quot;3880&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3837&quot; data-end=&quot;3847&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;&lt;code data-start=&quot;3839&quot; data-end=&quot;3846&quot;&gt;tkeep&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;3847&quot; data-end=&quot;3880&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;byte nào trong &lt;code data-start=&quot;3864&quot; data-end=&quot;3871&quot;&gt;tdata&lt;/code&gt; hợp lệ&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;3882&quot; data-end=&quot;4028&quot;&gt;AMD cũng liệt kê &lt;code data-start=&quot;3899&quot; data-end=&quot;3906&quot;&gt;tuser&lt;/code&gt; là Start of Frame và &lt;code data-start=&quot;3928&quot; data-end=&quot;3935&quot;&gt;tlast&lt;/code&gt; là End of Line trong bảng interface AXI4-Stream Video.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4030&quot; data-end=&quot;4033&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;4035&quot; data-end=&quot;4070&quot;&gt;4.2 AXI4 memory-mapped interface&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4072&quot; data-end=&quot;4124&quot;&gt;Đây là port DMA đi vào DDR hoặc memory interconnect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4126&quot; data-end=&quot;4233&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Frame Buffer Write:&lt;br&gt;AXI4-MM master write -&amp;gt; DDR&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Frame Buffer Read:&lt;br&gt;AXI4-MM master read  -&amp;gt; DDR&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4235&quot; data-end=&quot;4325&quot;&gt;IP sẽ tự tạo burst transaction theo width/height/stride/base address mà software cấu hình.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;4327&quot; data-end=&quot;4330&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;4332&quot; data-end=&quot;4366&quot;&gt;4.3 AXI4-Lite control interface&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4368&quot; data-end=&quot;4616&quot;&gt;AXI4-Lite dùng để CPU/MicroBlaze/ARM cấu hình IP. AMD nói AXI4-Lite cho phép điều khiển dynamic parameter trong core, có thể cấu hình bằng Arm embedded processor, MicroBlaze hoặc AXI4-Lite master state machine.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;4618&quot; data-end=&quot;4671&quot;&gt;Các register quan trọng được liệt kê trong PG278 gồm:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;4673&quot; data-end=&quot;5024&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Control register       0x0000&lt;br&gt;Global Interrupt Enable 0x0004&lt;br&gt;IP Interrupt Enable     0x0008&lt;br&gt;IP Interrupt Status     0x000C&lt;br&gt;Width                   0x0010&lt;br&gt;Height                  0x0018&lt;br&gt;Stride                  0x0020&lt;br&gt;Memory Video Format     0x0028&lt;br&gt;Plane1 Buffer           0x0030&lt;br&gt;Plane2 Buffer           0x003C&lt;br&gt;Plane3 Buffer           0x0054&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5026&quot; data-end=&quot;5133&quot;&gt;Danh sách này xuất hiện trong phần register space của tài liệu PG278.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;5135&quot; data-end=&quot;5138&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;5140&quot; data-end=&quot;5166&quot;&gt;5. Format dữ liệu hỗ trợ&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5168&quot; data-end=&quot;5215&quot;&gt;PG278 liệt kê nhiều memory video format, ví dụ:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;5217&quot; data-end=&quot;5377&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;RGBX8, BGRX8, YUVX8&lt;br&gt;YUYV8, UYVY8&lt;br&gt;RGBA8, BGRA8&lt;br&gt;RGB8, BGR8, YUV8&lt;br&gt;Y8&lt;br&gt;RGBX10, YUVX10&lt;br&gt;Y_UV8, Y_UV8_420&lt;br&gt;Y_U_V8, Y_U_V8_420&lt;br&gt;Y_UV10, Y_UV10_420&lt;br&gt;Y12, Y16&lt;br&gt;...&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5379&quot; data-end=&quot;5509&quot;&gt;Các format này được liệt kê trong mục Product Specification / Memory Video Format của PG278.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5511&quot; data-end=&quot;5822&quot;&gt;Điểm cần chú ý: AMD nói Frame Buffer Read/Write &lt;strong data-start=&quot;5559&quot; data-end=&quot;5623&quot;&gt;luôn yêu cầu hardware configuration là three component video&lt;/strong&gt;, nên nếu nối với IP 1-component hoặc 2-component như luma-only, YUV 4:2:2, YUV 4:2:0 thì có thể cần &lt;strong data-start=&quot;5724&quot; data-end=&quot;5756&quot;&gt;AXI4-Stream Subset Converter&lt;/strong&gt; để ghép/nối đúng interface.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;5824&quot; data-end=&quot;6061&quot;&gt;Điều này rất quan trọng với pipeline của bạn nếu muốn ghi RAW Bayer một kênh vào DDR. Xilinx Frame Buffer IP không nhất thiết tự hiểu “RAW Bayer custom” theo cách ISP của bạn hiểu. Bạn cần kiểm tra xem đang map RAW vào format nào, ví dụ:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;6063&quot; data-end=&quot;6207&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;RAW8  -&amp;gt; có thể map như Y8 / luma&lt;br&gt;RAW10 -&amp;gt; cần quyết định packed 10-bit hay 16-bit container&lt;br&gt;RAW12 -&amp;gt; có thể map như Y12 nếu phù hợp&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;6209&quot; data-end=&quot;6212&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;6214&quot; data-end=&quot;6265&quot;&gt;6. Vì sao IP này quan trọng trong video pipeline?&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;6267&quot; data-end=&quot;6297&quot;&gt;6.1 Tách nhịp giữa các khối&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;6299&quot; data-end=&quot;6438&quot;&gt;Camera/MIPI có thể chạy clock riêng. ISP/VIP/NPU/DDR chạy clock khác. Frame buffer giúp biến stream real-time thành frame nằm trong memory.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;6440&quot; data-end=&quot;6543&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;MIPI clock domain&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; Frame Buffer Write&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; DDR&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; Frame Buffer Read&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; ISP clock domain&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;6545&quot; data-end=&quot;6654&quot;&gt;Nhờ vậy, pipeline ổn định hơn. Nếu bỏ frame buffer giữa MIPI và ISP, bạn phải thay bằng FIFO/clock converter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;6656&quot; data-end=&quot;6659&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;6661&quot; data-end=&quot;6688&quot;&gt;6.2 Chống nghẽn pipeline&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;6690&quot; data-end=&quot;6763&quot;&gt;Nếu downstream tạm thời chưa sẵn sàng, frame buffer giúp lưu frame ở DDR.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;6765&quot; data-end=&quot;6771&quot;&gt;Ví dụ:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;6773&quot; data-end=&quot;6866&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Camera đang capture frame N&lt;br&gt;ISP đang xử lý frame N-1&lt;br&gt;NPU đang inference frame N-2&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;6868&quot; data-end=&quot;6917&quot;&gt;Đây là mô hình pipeline nhiều stage rất phổ biến.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;6919&quot; data-end=&quot;6922&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;6924&quot; data-end=&quot;6943&quot;&gt;6.3 Hỗ trợ debug&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;6945&quot; data-end=&quot;7012&quot;&gt;Có DDR Buffer A sau MIPI thì bạn có thể dump RAW frame để kiểm tra:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;7014&quot; data-end=&quot;7137&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;sensor có đúng Bayer order không?&lt;br&gt;RAW10 unpack đúng không?&lt;br&gt;MIPI có mất line không?&lt;br&gt;exposure/gain có đúng không?&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;7139&quot; data-end=&quot;7184&quot;&gt;Nếu không có buffer này, debug khó hơn nhiều.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;7186&quot; data-end=&quot;7189&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;7191&quot; data-end=&quot;7213&quot;&gt;6.4 Handoff cho NPU&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;7215&quot; data-end=&quot;7297&quot;&gt;Trong pipeline AI camera, Frame Buffer Write sau VIP tạo DDR Buffer B cho NPU đọc:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;7299&quot; data-end=&quot;7382&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;VIP output RGB/YUV&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; Frame Buffer Write&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; DDR Buffer B&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; NPU read&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;7384&quot; data-end=&quot;7453&quot;&gt;Điểm &lt;code data-start=&quot;7389&quot; data-end=&quot;7401&quot;&gt;frame done&lt;/code&gt; của Frame Buffer Write là thời điểm an toàn để báo:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;7455&quot; data-end=&quot;7492&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;Buffer B is ready for NPU&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;7494&quot; data-end=&quot;7497&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;7499&quot; data-end=&quot;7538&quot;&gt;7. So sánh Frame Buffer Write và VDMA&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;7540&quot; data-end=&quot;7707&quot;&gt;Bạn có thể gặp cả &lt;strong data-start=&quot;7558&quot; data-end=&quot;7570&quot;&gt;AXI VDMA&lt;/strong&gt; và &lt;strong data-start=&quot;7574&quot; data-end=&quot;7607&quot;&gt;Video Frame Buffer Write/Read&lt;/strong&gt; của Xilinx. Hai loại này giống nhau ở chỗ đều chuyển video stream ↔ memory, nhưng khác abstraction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;TyagGW_tableContainer&quot;&gt;&lt;div tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit&quot;&gt;&lt;table data-start=&quot;7709&quot; data-end=&quot;8149&quot; class=&quot;w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)&quot;&gt;&lt;thead data-start=&quot;7709&quot; data-end=&quot;7764&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;7709&quot; data-end=&quot;7764&quot;&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;7709&quot; data-end=&quot;7720&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;Tiêu chí&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;7720&quot; data-end=&quot;7731&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;AXI VDMA&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th data-start=&quot;7731&quot; data-end=&quot;7764&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot; class=&quot;last:pe-10&quot;&gt;Video Frame Buffer Read/Write&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody data-start=&quot;7779&quot; data-end=&quot;8149&quot;&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;7779&quot; data-end=&quot;7845&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;7779&quot; data-end=&quot;7790&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Mục tiêu&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;7790&quot; data-end=&quot;7810&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;DMA video generic&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;7810&quot; data-end=&quot;7845&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Frame buffer video format-aware&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;7846&quot; data-end=&quot;7900&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;7846&quot; data-end=&quot;7865&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Interface stream&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;7865&quot; data-end=&quot;7879&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;AXI4-Stream&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;7879&quot; data-end=&quot;7900&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;AXI4-Stream Video&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;7901&quot; data-end=&quot;7981&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;7901&quot; data-end=&quot;7919&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Cấu hình format&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;7919&quot; data-end=&quot;7955&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;thấp hơn, thiên về address/stride&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;7955&quot; data-end=&quot;7981&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;có Memory Video Format&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;7982&quot; data-end=&quot;8058&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;7982&quot; data-end=&quot;8000&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Multi-plane YUV&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;8000&quot; data-end=&quot;8018&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;không tiện bằng&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;8018&quot; data-end=&quot;8058&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;hỗ trợ plane/buffer cho nhiều format&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr data-start=&quot;8059&quot; data-end=&quot;8149&quot;&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;8059&quot; data-end=&quot;8091&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;Dùng trong video pipeline mới&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;8091&quot; data-end=&quot;8107&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;vẫn dùng được&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td data-start=&quot;8107&quot; data-end=&quot;8149&quot; data-col-size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;thường phù hợp hơn với video framework&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;8151&quot; data-end=&quot;8361&quot;&gt;Nếu pipeline của bạn cần format như RGB/YUV/NV12/YUYV, Frame Buffer Read/Write thường thuận tiện hơn. Nếu bạn chỉ cần DMA raw stream đơn giản, VDMA cũng có thể dùng được, nhưng phải tự quản lý format nhiều hơn.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;8363&quot; data-end=&quot;8366&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;8368&quot; data-end=&quot;8422&quot;&gt;8. Cấu hình cần quan tâm khi dùng trong ISP pipeline&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;8424&quot; data-end=&quot;8496&quot;&gt;Với mỗi Frame Buffer Write/Read, driver/software cần cấu hình tối thiểu:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;8498&quot; data-end=&quot;8680&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;width&lt;br&gt;height&lt;br&gt;stride&lt;br&gt;memory video format&lt;br&gt;base address plane 1&lt;br&gt;base address plane 2 nếu multi-plane&lt;br&gt;base address plane 3 nếu multi-plane&lt;br&gt;interrupt enable&lt;br&gt;start/stop control&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;8682&quot; data-end=&quot;8703&quot;&gt;Với pipeline của bạn:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;8705&quot; data-end=&quot;8753&quot;&gt;Frame Buffer Write 0 — MIPI RX → DDR Buffer A&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;8755&quot; data-end=&quot;8764&quot;&gt;Cần chốt:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;8766&quot; data-end=&quot;8991&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;input stream format: RAW8 / RAW10 / RAW12&lt;br&gt;memory format: Y8 / Y10-like / Y12 / custom mapping&lt;br&gt;width = sensor active width&lt;br&gt;height = sensor active height&lt;br&gt;stride = bytes per line, có alignment&lt;br&gt;base address = Buffer A&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;8993&quot; data-end=&quot;9028&quot;&gt;Rủi ro lớn nhất ở đây là &lt;strong data-start=&quot;9018&quot; data-end=&quot;9027&quot;&gt;RAW10&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;9030&quot; data-end=&quot;9118&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;RAW10 packed:   4 pixel = 5 bytes&lt;br&gt;RAW10 unpacked: 1 pixel = 16-bit container&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9120&quot; data-end=&quot;9210&quot;&gt;Nếu Write ghi theo unpacked 16-bit nhưng Read đọc theo packed RAW10, ảnh sẽ sai hoàn toàn.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;9212&quot; data-end=&quot;9215&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;9217&quot; data-end=&quot;9263&quot;&gt;Frame Buffer Read — DDR Buffer A → ISP-Lite&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9265&quot; data-end=&quot;9304&quot;&gt;Cần khớp 100% với Frame Buffer Write 0:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;9306&quot; data-end=&quot;9399&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;same width&lt;br&gt;same height&lt;br&gt;same stride&lt;br&gt;same memory format&lt;br&gt;same Bayer order assumption&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9401&quot; data-end=&quot;9451&quot;&gt;Nếu sai stride, dòng thứ 2 sẽ bắt đầu sai địa chỉ.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;9453&quot; data-end=&quot;9456&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-start=&quot;9458&quot; data-end=&quot;9502&quot;&gt;Frame Buffer Write 1 — VIP → DDR Buffer B&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9504&quot; data-end=&quot;9513&quot;&gt;Cần chốt:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;9515&quot; data-end=&quot;9670&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;VIP output width/height sau crop/downscale&lt;br&gt;pixel format RGB/BGR/GBR&lt;br&gt;bytes per pixel&lt;br&gt;stride&lt;br&gt;buffer count &amp;gt;= 2, tốt nhất 3&lt;br&gt;cache coherency policy&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9672&quot; data-end=&quot;9704&quot;&gt;Với NPU, nên dùng triple buffer:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;9706&quot; data-end=&quot;9767&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;B0: DMA đang ghi&lt;br&gt;B1: NPU đang đọc&lt;br&gt;B2: free buffer&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;9769&quot; data-end=&quot;9772&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;9774&quot; data-end=&quot;9791&quot;&gt;9. Clock của IP&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;9793&quot; data-end=&quot;10088&quot;&gt;PG278 ghi rằng các video streaming interface chạy ở clock speed của IP core, tức &lt;code data-start=&quot;9874&quot; data-end=&quot;9882&quot;&gt;ap_clk&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;AXI4-Lite control interface cũng chạy với clock control riêng được mô tả trong phần AXI4-Lite, thường cùng domain điều khiển IP.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10090&quot; data-end=&quot;10123&quot;&gt;Trong thiết kế thực tế, cần để ý:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;10125&quot; data-end=&quot;10231&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;AXI4-Stream video clock&lt;br&gt;AXI memory-mapped clock&lt;br&gt;AXI4-Lite control clock&lt;br&gt;DDR/interconnect clock&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10233&quot; data-end=&quot;10448&quot;&gt;Tùy cách generate IP, các clock này có thể được buộc cùng &lt;code data-start=&quot;10291&quot; data-end=&quot;10299&quot;&gt;ap_clk&lt;/code&gt; hoặc đi qua interconnect/clock converter. Nếu upstream của bạn là MIPI RX DVP-like &lt;code data-start=&quot;10383&quot; data-end=&quot;10392&quot;&gt;vid_clk&lt;/code&gt; chứ không phải AXI4-Stream cùng clock, bạn cần adapter:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;10450&quot; data-end=&quot;10581&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;MIPI RX DVP-like stream&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; DVP to AXI4-Stream Video converter&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; optional AXIS clock converter&lt;br&gt; -&amp;gt; Frame Buffer Write&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10583&quot; data-end=&quot;10679&quot;&gt;Không nên nối thẳng tín hiệu DVP &lt;code data-start=&quot;10616&quot; data-end=&quot;10633&quot;&gt;vsync/href/data&lt;/code&gt; vào IP nếu IP đang yêu cầu AXI4-Stream Video.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr data-start=&quot;10681&quot; data-end=&quot;10684&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 data-start=&quot;10686&quot; data-end=&quot;10713&quot;&gt;10. Tài liệu hãng nên đọc&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10715&quot; data-end=&quot;10734&quot;&gt;Các tài liệu chính:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol data-start=&quot;10736&quot; data-end=&quot;11396&quot;&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;10736&quot; data-end=&quot;10966&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;10739&quot; data-end=&quot;10829&quot;&gt;PG278 — Video Frame Buffer Read and Video Frame Buffer Write LogiCORE IP Product Guide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;10829&quot; data-end=&quot;10832&quot;&gt;Đây là tài liệu quan trọng nhất. Bản hiện tại trên AMD docs là v3.0, release date 2025-11-20.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;10968&quot; data-end=&quot;11154&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;10971&quot; data-end=&quot;11027&quot;&gt;UG934 — AXI4-Stream Video IP and System Design Guide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;11027&quot; data-end=&quot;11030&quot;&gt;PG278 nói AXI4-Stream Video interface của IP tuân theo specification trong UG934.&lt;span class=&quot;&quot; data-state=&quot;closed&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-start=&quot;11156&quot; data-end=&quot;11396&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;11159&quot; data-end=&quot;11265&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;11159&quot; data-end=&quot;11200&quot;&gt;AMD/Xilinx embeddedsw driver examples&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;11200&quot; data-end=&quot;11203&quot;&gt;Nên tìm trong source tree Vitis/embeddedsw các driver kiểu:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-vis