        <mxCell id="3UOazP-85POwUwZDba4x-13" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;10&quot; data-end=&quot;174&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;10&quot; data-end=&quot;70&quot;&gt;Trong 1 beat, các bit của &lt;code data-start=&quot;38&quot; data-end=&quot;45&quot;&gt;TDATA&lt;/code&gt; được truyền song song.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br data-start=&quot;70&quot; data-end=&quot;73&quot;&gt;&#xa;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;73&quot; data-end=&quot;174&quot;&gt;Qua nhiều beat, các beat được truyền nối tiếp theo thời gian, mỗi beat ở một chu kì clock hợp lệ.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;176&quot; data-end=&quot;226&quot;&gt;Với &lt;strong data-start=&quot;180&quot; data-end=&quot;205&quot;&gt;RGB888 = 24 bit/pixel&lt;/strong&gt; và &lt;strong data-start=&quot;209&quot; data-end=&quot;225&quot;&gt;2 pixel/beat&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;228&quot; data-end=&quot;330&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Trong 1 beat:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;TDATA[47:0] truyền song song 48 bit cùng lúc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;= Pixel1 24 bit + Pixel0 24 bit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;332&quot; data-end=&quot;341&quot;&gt;Minh họa:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;343&quot; data-end=&quot;660&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;cm-scroller&quot;&gt;&lt;pre class=&quot;cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tại một cạnh lên ACLK hợp lệ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;TVALID = 1, TREADY = 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;TDATA[47:0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;┌──────────────────────┬──────────────────────┐&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ Pixel1 = 24 bit      │ Pixel0 = 24 bit      │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;│ R1 G1 B1             │ R0 G0 B0             │&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;└──────────────────────┴──────────────────────┘&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;=&amp;gt; 48 bit này xuất hiện cùng lúc trên bus TDATA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&lt;p data-start=&quot;662&quot; data-end=&quot;764&quot;&gt;Nếu frame có 8 pixel: &lt;code data-start=&quot;684&quot; data-end=&quot;709&quot;&gt;P0 P1 P2 P3 P4 P5 P6 P7&lt;/code&gt;, và bạn cấu hình &lt;strong data-start=&quot;727&quot; data-end=&quot;743&quot;&gt;2 pixel/beat&lt;/strong&gt;, thì truyền như sau:&lt;/p&gt;&#xa;&lt;pre class=&quot;overflow-visible! px-0!&quot; data-start=&quot;766&quot; data-end=&quot;901&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative w-full mt-4 mb-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contents&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full min-h-0 min-w-0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pe-11 pt-3&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;relative z-0 flex max-w-full&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;code-block-viewer&